  "post_content": "<p>El auditorio de la Uni&oacute;n Musical Santa Cecilia de Onda ha acogido la tarde de este martes el primer ensayo general de su coro y orquesta, reforzada por la Filarm&oacute;nica Mart&iacute;n y Soler de Valencia, con el grupo Dios Salve a la Reina.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2017/07/IMG_1649.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>Durante dos d&iacute;as m&aacute;s preparar&aacute;n concienzudamente el tributo a Queen que brindar&aacute;n la noche del viernes 28, a las 23 horas, en el Recinto Multiusos.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1598.jpg\" alt=\"img_1598\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1599.jpg\" alt=\"img_1599\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1600.jpg\" alt=\"img_1600\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1601.jpg\" alt=\"img_1601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1603.jpg\" alt=\"img_1603\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1604.jpg\" alt=\"img_1604\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1605.jpg\" alt=\"img_1605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_1606.jpg\" alt=\"img_1606\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/assaigprimerqueen/img_